'''Prayer items''' are equipment which give [[Prayer]] bonuses when worn.

==How Prayer items work==
Each Prayer bonus point increases the time it takes for prayer points to deplete by 3.33% additively.

For example, having +30 Prayer bonus would make Prayers last 100% longer (twice as long). [[Protect from Melee]] would then drain 1 Prayer point every 6 seconds, instead of every 3 seconds. 

With at least +42 Prayer bonus, [[protection prayer]]s will drain slowly enough that the [[prayer regeneration potion]] effect will upkeep the player's prayer without the need for additional [[prayer potion]]s.

The highest Prayer bonus possible is 73.

